# ---- Backup of previous git history (kept locally for rollback, never tracked) ----
.git.bak-*/

# ---- Build outputs ----
**/_build/
**/out/
**/merged_out/

# ---- Third-party DFP / CMSIS packs (restored by the package manager) ----
**/packs/

# ---- MCC / CMake generated cache ----
**/cmake/**/.generated/
**/compile_commands.json
**/memoryfile.xml
**/*.ninja
**/.ninja_deps
**/.ninja_log
**/CMakeConfigureLog.yaml
**/CMakeCache.txt*

# ---- Compiled objects / binaries / listings ----
**/*.o
**/*.elf
**/*.hex
**/*.bin
**/*.map
**/*.lst

# ---- Backup / temporary files ----
**/*.bak
**/*.protocol.bak
**/*.tmp*
**/*.check_cache

# ---- Local IDE debug config (tool serial / machine-specific paths) ----
**/.vscode/*.mplab-local.json
**/.vscode/settings.json

# ---- Legacy / excluded items (kept on disk, not tracked) ----
/Bootloader双Bank使用手册.md
/BL工程改造为Fail-Safe双Bank_修改说明.md
/pic32cx_sg41_cult.X/
/pic32cx_sg41_curiosity_ultra.X/
/docs/*.pdf
/Tools/verify_merged_bin.py
/Tools/inspect_hex.py
